WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.455
Hello, everyone! I'm Ms. Lily. Welcome to Public Speaking!

2
00:00:05.755 --> 00:00:07.827
Hi! I'm Malis!

3
00:00:08.127 --> 00:00:10.672
Today's topic is Bigger and Smaller.

4
00:00:11.683 --> 00:00:18.411
Today we practise speaking in front of friends. Stand tall, smile, and use a big voice.

5
00:00:19.417 --> 00:00:20.104
Bigger!

6
00:00:21.004 --> 00:00:23.018
Bigger. Your turn!

7
00:00:25.918 --> 00:00:26.745
Bigger!

8
00:00:27.045 --> 00:00:27.767
Great!

9
00:00:28.783 --> 00:00:29.773
Smaller!

10
00:00:30.673 --> 00:00:32.466
Smaller. Your turn!

11
00:00:35.366 --> 00:00:36.611
Smaller!

12
00:00:36.911 --> 00:00:38.075
Wonderful!

13
00:00:39.083 --> 00:00:39.875
Taller!

14
00:00:40.775 --> 00:00:42.603
Taller. Your turn!

15
00:00:45.503 --> 00:00:46.412
Taller!

16
00:00:46.712 --> 00:00:47.481
Super!

17
00:00:48.483 --> 00:00:49.531
Shorter!

18
00:00:50.431 --> 00:00:52.247
Shorter. Your turn!

19
00:00:55.147 --> 00:00:56.067
Shorter!

20
00:00:56.367 --> 00:00:57.403
Excellent!

21
00:00:58.417 --> 00:01:05.402
Tip one: look at your friends. Tip two: speak slowly. Tip three: smile!

22
00:01:05.702 --> 00:01:06.959
I can do it!

23
00:01:07.950 --> 00:01:19.344
Hello, everyone! My name is Malis. Today I talk about Bigger and Smaller. My father is taller than my mother. I am older than my sister. Thank you!

24
00:01:19.644 --> 00:01:21.179
Wonderful speech!

25
00:01:22.183 --> 00:01:30.469
Now you speak. Say hello, say your name, then say: My father is taller than my mother. I am older than my sister.

26
00:01:38.769 --> 00:01:40.339
Clap, clap, clap!

27
00:01:40.639 --> 00:01:42.781
Brave and bright! Well done!

28
00:01:43.783 --> 00:01:49.573
Great job today, everyone! See you next time. Bye-bye!

29
00:01:49.873 --> 00:01:52.000
Bye-bye!

